{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1003471-advise-running-time-travel-scenarios","id":1003471,"title":"[Advise] Running Time Travel scenarios","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-15T10:31:30-08:00","id":1003471,"title":"[Advise] Running Time Travel scenarios","content":"So I plan to run plot in my archeomancers game where they will be Time Traveling to the point of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/718396-dark-eras-to-the-strongest-first-order-caucus\">Arrows First ( Asian ) Caucus</a>. It will work as superpowered Time Master or Archmaster spell, so they will be just send almost two and half thousand years back. And here is the question - <b>Better is to send modern characters in person or let PCs make their 'ancient selves' avatars? </b>I suspect that rules follow first example, but running 'you enter consciousness of ancestor' should be rather easily in <b>Mage</b>.<br /> <br /> It also could help solve high power level of cabal I run this where they are Gnosis 6+ mages with one Mastery or double Adept ranks.<br /> <br /> <b>What are you observations on running this kind far Time Traveling stories?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T11:53:02-08:00","id":1003517,"title":"","content":"Either scenario works since you're just doing archmastety bs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T14:30:59-08:00","id":1003608,"title":"","content":"I was planning something like this in our game but it's not near there yet.<br /> <br /> I really don't like making the players play other characters. What's the point of creating and building up Vritra if she's going to be unused for several months of play? And what's the fun in going through an ancient character's aspirations if they're not going to help out their 'real' character? There's something to be said for exploration and obviously you can create some sort of parallel advancement system to ameliorate things but I think it's better to just send the characters back as-is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T04:58:08-08:00","id":1003865,"title":"","content":"I wonder if the magic should be powerful or changed for the 'natives' of past Eras. In 1E books there is all around time talk about how now modern Masters were merely Aprentices in eons before. <b>Should my modern day PC ( on Adepts and Masters levels ) be on the same spell casting possibilities of previous Eras sorcerers? </b>And I mean here more about moving power of mages of past than making PCs weaker.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T05:28:07-08:00","id":1003874,"title":"","content":"I think that may have been more wishful thinking than anything, or talking about pre-Fall. Especially what with how long an eon is, technically. There's no suggestion of it happening as far back as the Neolithic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T05:39:02-08:00","id":1003878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1003471-advise-running-time-travel-scenarios?p=1003865#post1003865\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if the magic should be powerful or changed for the 'natives' of past Eras. In 1E books there is all around time talk about how now modern Masters were merely Aprentices in eons before. <b>Should my modern day PC ( on Adepts and Masters levels ) be on the same spell casting possibilities of previous Eras sorcerers? </b>And I mean here more about moving power of mages of past than making PCs weaker.</div> </div> </div> </div>Only if they're going back to a pre-Fall era.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}